# Allowlist: the ingestion image (workers/ingestion/Dockerfile, built from the
# repository root) receives only tracked source it needs. Local data, private
# notes, credentials, and node_modules never enter the build context.
*
!config/*.json
!packages/domain/*.json
!tests/fixtures/meetings.json
!workers/ingestion/pyproject.toml
!workers/ingestion/README.md
!workers/ingestion/build_hook.py
!workers/ingestion/tahoe_ingest/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
